function updateFilmProgress(){let form=$('#filmForm');if(!form)return;let required=['title','internationalTitle','year','productionCountry','duration','languages','subtitles','logline','shortSynopsis','longSynopsis','director','production','producer','directorBio','directorStatement','email','screeningUrl','trailer','poster','presskit'];let filled=required.filter(k=>String(form.elements[k]?.value||'').trim()).length;let missing=required.filter(k=>!String(form.elements[k]?.value||'').trim()).map(k=>form.elements[k]?.previousElementSibling?.textContent||k);let pct=Math.round(filled/required.length*100);$('#filmProgress').innerHTML=`<div class=readiness><div><b>Dossier prêt : ${filled}/${required.length}</b><span>${pct}% des informations essentielles</span></div><div class=progress><i style="width:${pct}%"></i></div>${missing.length?`<details><summary>${missing.length} information(s) à compléter</summary><p>${missing.map(esc).join(' · ')}</p></details>`:'<strong>✓ Informations essentielles complètes</strong>'}</div>`}
$('#saveFilmBtn')?.addEventListener('click',saveFilm);$('#filmForm')?.addEventListener('input',updateFilmProgress);
